Existing installed diagnostic needed START confirmation and sent no DATA without its receiver.
Explicit half-demo TX-only build: configured 433MHz, SF7, BW125, CR4/5, preamble8, explicit header, PHY CRC, sync0x34, TX10dBm.
Stable identity 0x12 in 16/16 reads; frequency/modem/power/sync register readbacks matched.
SPI4MHz: 3 TxDone completions, then packet 4 timeout (IRQ=00, mode=80, DIO0=0).
SPI1MHz final repeat: 10/10 34-byte diagnostic packets completed; ten exact FIFO readbacks and ten deferred DIO0 callbacks; no timeout.
Local TxDone timing: min77ms, mean77.1ms, max78ms.
One intermediate premature mode-readback assertion was excluded; the final completion criterion was TxDone within one second.
This is local transmitter evidence only; reception, range, radiated RF power and antenna performance are unverified.
Sender, head, ML-only and radio-only builds passed; the four native/HTTP test groups passed after the test-mode addition.
